# Every file in this repository is tooling text and every one of them is LF: bash
# reads the scripts on macOS and Linux, where a stray CR breaks `set -euo pipefail`,
# and the packaging hashes in dist/publish/SHA256SUMS.txt are computed over LF bytes.
# Without this, a clone on a machine with core.autocrlf=true yields a tree whose
# .sh files differ from the ones that were published.
* text eol=lf
